{'symbol': 'KMB', 'date': '2022-07-12 14:00:00', 'title': 'KIMBERLY-CLARK ANNOUNCES SCHEDULE FOR SECOND QUARTER 2022 FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': "DALLAS , JULY 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KIMBERLY-CLARK CORPORATION (NYSE: KMB) WILL ISSUE ITS SECOND QUARTER 2022 RESULTS ON TUESDAY, JULY 26 WITH A NEWS RELEASE ISSUED VIA PR NEWSWIRE AND FIRST CALL AT APPROXIMATELY 6:30 A.M. CDT. IN ADDITION TO THE NEWS RELEASE, THE COMPANY WILL MAKE AVAILABLE PREPARED MANAGEMENT REMARKS FROM KIMBERLY-CLARK'S CHAIRMAN AND CEO MIKE HSU AND CFO NELSON URDANETA AT APPROXIMATELY 7 A.M."}